      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty strong stance lol. but doesn't it seem a bit hypocritical though? like, a lot of people argue that sanctions often end up hurting the regular people living there instead of the leaders, and it mostly just serves the interests of the countries imposing them. how can you call it \"upholding norms\" if it's basically just forcing your own political values on other sovereign nations?",
