      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah, i get that it's \"contested,\" but at the end of the day, if sanctions mostly hurt innocent people and just help big countries get their way, isn't the \"pro-democracy\" argument kind of just a cover story? like, if they actually hurt democracy more than they help it, shouldn't we just say that they're fundamentally an unethical tool?",
